---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume – Peter Hagen">
  <section class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mb-6 space-y-2">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-50 sm:text-3xl">
          Resume
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-300 sm:text-base">
          A quick recruiter-facing snapshot of where I fit best, what I build, and where to go next before opening the full PDF.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr,1fr]">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-300">
            Best-fit roles
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Data Engineer</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Analytics Engineer</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Business Intelligence Engineer</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>AI / data workflow roles with a strong pipeline or decision-support component</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-300">
            Good starting points
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li><a href="/projects/obsidian-rag-chat" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">Obsidian RAG Chat</a></li>
            <li><a href="/projects/ai-pipeline-operational-insights" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">End-to-end AI pipeline for operational insights</a></li>
            <li><a href="/projects/govcon-analytics-dashboard" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">GovCon analytics dashboard for mission KPIs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/projects/nova-data-center-energy" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">NOVA Data Center Energy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 text-xs text-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 sm:text-sm">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-300">Data Engineering</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Designed and maintained data pipelines using Python, SQL, and AWS-flavored tooling.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Built automated workflows and reporting layers for large operational and membership datasets.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Created data models for segmentation, retention, KPI tracking, and recurring decision support.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Focused on reliability, metric consistency, and reducing manual reporting friction.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-300">Analytics &amp; Decision Support</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Built dashboards and analytics products used to monitor performance, engagement, and operational trends.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Translated ambiguous stakeholder questions into clearer KPI systems and reporting structures.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Worked comfortably between technical implementation and executive-facing communication.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Strong experience with Tableau, SQL reporting, and custom visualization work.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-300">AI / Workflow Systems</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Built RAG-style retrieval systems, text-processing workflows, and AI-assisted automation pipelines.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Connected model outputs back to operational questions rather than treating ML as notebook-only work.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Comfortable with document workflows, embeddings, monitoring, and end-to-end proof-of-concept systems.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span><span>Interested in the overlap between data engineering, applied AI, and decision-support tooling.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <p class="flex-1">For the full chronology and latest details, download the PDF version of my resume.</p>
        <a
          href="/pdf/Peter-Hagen-Resume.pdf"
          download
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-400 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-teal-300 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-950 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Download PDF
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="aspect-[8.5/11] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80">
        <iframe
          title="Peter Hagen Resume PDF"
          src="/pdf/Peter-Hagen-Resume.pdf"
          class="h-full w-full"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="sr-only">
          If the PDF does not display, please use the download button above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
